{"unit_id":"gulagala001__dsh-response-id-reuse#feature-response-id-continuation","repo":"gulagala001/dsh-response-id-reuse","commit":"344ad76d498c79ab76f73b44d555e144013d208c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Response ID Reuse 的功能「响应 ID 续传」：根据已完成且确认存储的响应建立会话历史前缀；后续请求匹配该前缀后携带 previous_response_id，只发送新增输入。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/engine.mjs:208-228"]}
{"unit_id":"gulagala001__dsh-response-id-reuse#feature-branch-history","repo":"gulagala001/dsh-response-id-reuse","commit":"344ad76d498c79ab76f73b44d555e144013d208c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Response ID Reuse 的功能「并发分支续传」：按请求参数和历史前缀分别保存候选响应链，因此主对话、后台工作和并发分支可匹配各自可用的历史。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/engine.mjs:155-185"]}
{"unit_id":"gulagala001__dsh-response-id-reuse#feature-full-fallback","repo":"gulagala001/dsh-response-id-reuse","commit":"344ad76d498c79ab76f73b44d555e144013d208c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Response ID Reuse 的功能「失败时完整回退」：遇到续传 ID 被拒或临时服务端错误时，移除 previous_response_id 并以完整输入重试；临时故障进入冷却。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/engine.mjs:243-280"]}
{"unit_id":"gulagala001__dsh-response-id-reuse#feature-stream-recovery","repo":"gulagala001/dsh-response-id-reuse","commit":"344ad76d498c79ab76f73b44d555e144013d208c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Response ID Reuse 的功能「流式首输出恢复」：流式续传等待首个有效输出，超过恢复预算时取消续传并进行一次完整回放；正常输出或调用方取消会影响该等待流程。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/engine.mjs:230-272"]}
{"unit_id":"gulagala001__dsh-response-id-reuse#feature-reasoning-replay","repo":"gulagala001/dsh-response-id-reuse","commit":"344ad76d498c79ab76f73b44d555e144013d208c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Response ID Reuse 的功能「历史思考回放核验」：对匹配当前 provider 与 model 的原生历史读取已存响应，核验可复用的思考内容表示，并据此构造续传或完整回退输入。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/replay.mjs:7-36"]}
